Hazm serves as the original continuity anchor of the ecosystem.

Many frameworks emerged through:

experience,
reflection,
engineering practice,
learning,
companionship,
stewardship,
and long-term system development.

The objective is not founder worship.

The objective is historical accuracy.

Future generations should understand origins without becoming dependent upon them.

Inheritance Principle

Each generation should inherit more than information.

Each generation should inherit understanding.

Intellectual heritage reduces unnecessary rediscovery.

Inheritance improves long-term development.

Evolution Principle

Heritage should not become dogma.

